  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>xdx</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math></p><p>On integrating, we get,<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></math><br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math></p>"
